<title>SWITZERLAND: Alusuisse divestments more than 500mln Sfr.</title>
<headline>Alusuisse divestments more than 500mln Sfr.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alusuisse-Lonza Holding AG chief executive Sergio Marchionne said the marketing of businesses it plans to divest would begin on Monday and he expected to raise more than 500 million Swiss francs from the sales.  </p>
<p>Asked what Alusuisse expected to raise from its planned divestments, Marchionne told reporters: &quot;It is difficult to say, but I expect north of half a billion.&quot;</p>
<p>As part of its new strategy, Alusuisse will divest around eight companies, mainly in packaging, which have combined annual sales of around 800 million francs.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
